WP01 Rust protocol proof

Rust protocol changes: none in this slice.

Reason:
- WP01 establishes TypeScript contract boundaries first.
- Sidecar Rust analysis confirmed current Rust app_game.rs only exposes
  AppGameSessionSummary and AppGameSessionReport.
- Inventory, evidence-claim, runtime, approval authority, and AI digest parity
  should wait for these TypeScript schemas to stabilize and remain test-backed.

Negative Rust follow-up cases queued for later parity slice:
- confidence outside 0..1 rejected or never emitted;
- foreground plus background duration never exceeds running duration;
- permission or adapter-error never becomes possiblyGame;
- inventory evidence cannot claim running or foreground;
- display-name-only identity remains weak and unlinked;
- launcher evidence cannot mark knownGame without child-game proof.
